        "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Want to stay on top of the science and politics driving biotech today?&#xa0;<a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/signup/readout/\">Sign up</a>&#xa0;to get our biotech newsletter in your inbox.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Good morning. Hope you had a wonderful Thanksgiving. If you&#x2019;re working today, good luck pressing through one more day to the weekend.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-fda-extends-review-of-vertex-kidney-drug\">FDA extends review of Vertex kidney drug</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The FDA is <a href=\"https://news.vrtx.com/news-releases/news-release-details/vertex-announces-extension-pdufa-target-action-date-three-months\" rel=\"noopener\">extending</a> its assessment of Vertex&#x2019;s investigational kidney drug, as the company faces questions about potential safety concerns.&#xa0;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/27/fda-vertex-povetacicept-kidney-capricor-duchenne-readout-newsletter/?utm_campaign=rss\">Continue to STAT+ to read the full story&hellip;</a></p>"
